WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.660 --> 00:00:04.300
Anyway, by the time we got there, things were really bad.

2
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:08.100
We got out, we went in the house and it was late.

3
00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:10.860
It was almost time to go to bed but as a kid, I was petrified.

4
00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:11.720
I was a nervous wreck.

5
00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:14.600
I couldn't possibly go to bed, right?

6
00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:16.820
So mom was nervous, everybody was nervous.

7
00:00:16.820 --> 00:00:19.960
They wanted the kids in bed and away, so I was nervous.

8
00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:22.440
I threw up in bed.

9
00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:30.080
I remember that the boards that my aunt had put against her window were pounding and one of the windows crashed on top of me.

10
00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:33.440
There was no way I was getting back in bed, so I was a wreck all night.

11
00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:46.100
But the most harrowing thing was when the men got together to murmur the Rosary.

12
00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:48.620
When women pray, it's alright.

13
00:00:48.620 --> 00:00:52.000
When men pray, you know something's wrong.

14
00:00:52.000 --> 00:01:00.080
And that was probably . . . It wasn't the nervousness, it wasn't because my dad wasn't there although those were tremendously big emotional things.

15
00:01:00.080 --> 00:01:01.540
It wasn't the glass falling on me.

16
00:01:01.540 --> 00:01:06.620
When my grandpa and the other men started praying, that was scary.
